0000_Oral_Histories_Korean_War_Veteran_Carl_House", "rico:isAssociatedWithDate": "2020-08-04T00:00:00Z", "rico:isOrWasIncludedIn": {"@id": "set:ia:IA Collection › TV-CSPAN3"}, "rico:scopeAndContent": "The Korean War began on June 25, 1950 and ended with an armistice agreement about three years later in July 1953. Korean War veteran Carl House recounted his part in the amphibious landing at Inchon, a victory for U.N. forces which turned the tide early in the war, and talked about the surprise Chinese counterattack and intense combat at the Battle of Chosin Reservoir where he was captured. He als", "prov:wasGeneratedBy": {"@type": "prov:Activity", "prov:label": "KOREA ARCHIVE 통합검색 발견(검색어 비공개)", "prov:startedAtTime": "2026-11-23T03:14:21Z", "prov:used": ["ia"]}}, {"@id": "https://archive.org/details/VOA_Africa_20180731_190000", "@type": "rico:Record", "rico:title": "VOA [Voice of America] Africa : July 31, 2018 03:00PM-04:00PM EDT", "rico:identifier": "VOA_Africa_20180731_190000", "rico:isAssociatedWithDate": "2018-07-31T00:00:00Z", "rico:isOrWasIncludedIn": {"@id": "set:ia:IA Collection › Radio-VOA-Africa"}, "rico:scopeAndContent": "Closed captions transcript: 00:00:00 Eastern and western provinces killing and wounding scores of people in western fire 00:00:04 a province official said 00:00:06 a roadside bomb early Tuesday killed at least 11 bus passengers there were no 00:00:11 immediate claims of responsibility for the attack hours later an unknown number of 00:00:16 heavily armed suicide bombers assaulted government buildi", "prov:wasGeneratedBy": {"@type": "prov:Activity", "prov:label": "KOREA ARCHIVE 통합검색 발견(검색어 비공개)", "prov:startedAtTime": "2026-11-23T03:14:21Z", "prov:used": ["ia"]}}, {"@id": "https://archive.org/details/VOA_Global_English_20200620_130000", "@type": "rico:Record", "rico:title": "VOA [Voice of America] Global English : June 20, 2020 09:00AM-10:00AM EDT", "rico:identifier": "VOA_Global_English_20200620_130000", "rico:isAssociatedWithDate": "2020-